      "writtenOn": "2024-10-09T16:07:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "-- Calling this interface from multiple concurrent system applications should be allowed.\nYes, it\u0027s allowed. `BluetoothHciVendorSpecificDispatcher.register()` create an UUID at the registration (identifying the application). This UUID is next used as a Cookie. The Command Status or Complete is then rerouted to the calling application, by `BluetoothHciVendorSpecificDispatcher.dispatchCommandReturn()`.\n\n-- The same event can be unmasked by different system applications.\nYes. Each event is broadcasted, since the it\u0027s unmasked, `BluetoothHciVendorSpecificDispatcher.broadcastEvent()` filters registered application than masked the event, and wake-up all others.",
      "parentUuid": "df715a86_f4ee49a5",
      "revId": "162ce19015f3a9e05842b5a3639f3f7a9cd85c58",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
